Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 16:06:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: add NVIDIA NIM provider (Kimi K3) + compat &
 performance fixes

- providers: NVIDIA NIM provider with Kimi K3; muse-spark models use /v1/responses
- providers: minimax anthropic-compat endpoint requires X-Api-Key header
- media-gen: parallel TTS generation with bounded concurrency (TTS_CONCURRENCY, default 4)
- storage: retry atomic rename on Windows (EPERM/EACCES/EBUSY backoff)
- instrumentation: guard process.on for non-Node SSR runtimes
- gitignore: local work files
